
>> city := 数组对象 ← ['London'] ; ['Paris'] ; ['Berlin'].
>> temperature := 数组对象 ← ['15'] ; ['16'] ; ['15'].
>> weather := temperature 按: city.
>> cities := weather 所有项 排序: { :a :b <- (a 比较: b). }.
>> temperatures := weather 所有值 排序: { :a :b <- (a 比较: b) 负数?. }.

输出 写入: (cities 连接: [',']), 停止.
输出 写入: (temperatures 连接: [',']), 停止.
